{"name":"The Axis Key","slug":"glyph-axis-key","blurb":"On the palindrome street, Leif carries the key toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Axis. Click the key and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Axis Key.","seal":"6677ec43fa7a5614a220c0ff0546401d954e8b42cb9d64bb69418cdc03243cdb"}
